
(7 pākahi?) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], laina-hou. }, ʻi-ole-ia: { Huapuka kākau: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 pālua?) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], laina-hou. }, ʻi-ole-ia: { Huapuka kākau: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 pālua?) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['WRONG!']. }, ʻi-ole-ia: { Huapuka kākau: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], laina-hou. }.
(6 pākahi?) ʻoiaʻiʻo: { Huapuka kākau: ['WRONG!']. }, ʻi-ole-ia: { Huapuka kākau: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], laina-hou. }.
